# Preserve provenance-pinned source/configuration bytes on every platform.
# Some historical JSON protocols have CRLF; normalizing them changes SHA-256.
* -text
*.md text eol=lf
*.bib text eol=lf
requirements*.txt text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
